        "timestamp": 1777417414
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have a <code>@[csimp]</code> lemma that replaces <code>ofBoolListLE</code> with a tree-merge based implementation using <code>Array UInt64</code> internally, that should hopefully be O(n * log n). I'll do some sanity checks tomorrow. It's a bit overkill perhaps --- I don't know how optimized we want our BitVec functions, to be honest!</p>",
        "id": 591803253,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1777470758
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Great, thanks!</p>\n<p>I'm personally more concerned about crashing than how fast it is (though I expect others will benefit from speed as well).</p>",
        "id": 591804853,
        "sender_full_name": "Adomas Baliuka",
        "timestamp": 1777471061
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The crashing part will also be helped by <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/12971\">lean4#12971</a> in practice</p>",
        "id": 591805916,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Ullrich",
        "timestamp": 1777471283
    }
